{"nodes":[{"id":"g-mainlib","type":"group","x":-2800,"y":-1150,"width":2600,"height":2900,"color":"4","label":"main library — 共通エラー・機能・実行境界"},{"id":"g-public","type":"group","x":100,"y":-1150,"width":1100,"height":3300,"color":"5","label":"private sublibrary ragscope-logging — 公開Facade"},{"id":"g-internal","type":"group","x":1400,"y":-1150,"width":3600,"height":3300,"color":"6","label":"private sublibrary ragscope-logging — 内部実装"},{"id":"g-boundary","type":"group","x":5200,"y":-1150,"width":900,"height":2700,"color":"3","label":"契約・出力境界"},{"id":"g-tests","type":"group","x":100,"y":2350,"width":4900,"height":900,"color":"2","label":"test-suite ragscope-test"},{"id":"status","type":"text","x":-2800,"y":-1600,"width":8900,"height":300,"color":"1","text":"# RAGScope 共通エラー・実行観測・構造化ログ — 現在の全体像\n\n**RS-0015 の共通基盤は `main` に実装済み。** ただし executable `Main.hs` は現在まだ `Hello, Haskell!` のみで、`Logging.Setup` を使う composition root の実配線は未実施。下図は **現在存在する共通基盤と、その利用境界** を示す。"},{"id":"app-error","type":"text","x":-1000,"y":-950,"width":620,"height":470,"color":"4","text":"# `RAGScope.Error.Types`\n\n**アプリ共通エラーの値**\n\n`AppError` は5項目を保持する。\n- `category`\n- `code`\n- `message`\n- `context`\n- `cause`\n\n`cause` は元の技術的例外。**構造化ログへは渡さない。** ログへ投影するのは安全性を確認した情報だけ。"},{"id":"feature","type":"text","x":-2620,"y":-250,"width":520,"height":380,"color":"4","text":"## 機能処理\n\n機能自身は **機能の成功/失敗** を返す。\n\n代表形:\n```haskell\nIO (Either AppError a)\n```\n\nJSON・stderr・UUID・時刻・Sinkを知らない。\n\n※ RS-0015 は共通基盤まで。具体的な機能処理は各後続機能で実装する。"},{"id":"observation","type":"text","x":-1900,"y":-300,"width":520,"height":650,"color":"4","text":"# `RAGScope.Execution.Observation`\n\n**「処理して、その結果を必ず1回観測する」実行境界**\n\n`observe`:\n1. `featureAction` を1回実行\n2. その `Either AppError a` を変更せず `recordResult` へ渡す\n3. 必須ログ記録を1回試行\n4. 2つの結果を `ExecutionOutcome` にまとめる\n5. 解釈は `Execution.Result` へ委譲\n\n機能失敗時でもログ記録を試す。ログ失敗を同じ経路へ再帰出力しない。"},{"id":"result","type":"text","x":-1900,"y":750,"width":520,"height":770,"color":"4","text":"# `RAGScope.Execution.Result`\n\n**2軸の事実を純粋に解釈する層**\n\n```haskell\nExecutionOutcome\n  { featureResult :: Either AppError a\n  , loggingResult :: Either LoggingFailure ()\n  }\n```\n\n`AppAction a = ExceptT ExecutionFailure IO a`\n\n`ExecutionFailure`:\n- `FeatureFailed AppError`\n- `LoggingFailedAfterSuccess LoggingFailure`\n- `FeatureFailedWithLoggingFailure AppError LoggingFailure`\n\n**両方失敗しても元の `AppError` を失わない。** IOの実行順序は持たず、結果の意味だけを決める。"},{"id":"feature-log","type":"text","x":-1000,"y":-250,"width":620,"height":600,"color":"4","text":"## 機能ログ定義\n\n**`RAGScope.*.Logging` に置く境界**\n\n- 機能固有の閉じたイベント型を定義\n- `ToEventSpec` で共通 `EventSpec` へ写像\n- `AppError` から `LogError` へ安全な情報だけを投影\n- `operation` / `event` / `payload` の意味を機能側が所有\n\n通常の機能処理に任意の文字列・任意payloadを組み立てさせない。\n\n※ 共通基盤はこのためのAPIを提供済み。具体イベントは各機能で追加する。"},{"id":"logging","type":"text","x":280,"y":-250,"width":700,"height":300,"color":"5","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging`\n\n**通常利用の最小Facade**\n\n公開:\n- `Logger`\n- `LoggingFailure(..)`\n- `emit`\n\n`Runtime` を通常利用側から隠す。`emit` は型付きイベントを受け取り、`IO (Either LoggingFailure ())` を返す。"},{"id":"eventspec","type":"text","x":280,"y":850,"width":700,"height":470,"color":"5","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.EventSpec`\n\n**機能ログ定義専用の低水準Facade**\n\n公開する中心API:\n- `ToEventSpec`\n- `EventSpec`\n- `Payload` / `LogValue`\n- `LogError` / `LogErrorCategory`\n- `debugEventSpec` / `infoEventSpec` / `warnEventSpec`\n- `failedEventSpec`\n\n通常の機能処理ではなく、機能ログ定義境界から使う。"},{"id":"setup","type":"text","x":280,"y":-1050,"width":700,"height":650,"color":"5","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Setup`\n\n**production用 `Logger` を組み立てるFacade**\n\n公開:\n- `LoggingConfig { minimumLevel }`\n- `newExecutionId`\n- `mkExecutionLogger`\n- `mkServiceLogger`\n\n現在のproduction選択:\n- component = `RAGScopeApp`\n- EventId = UUID v4\n- Clock = 現在UTC時刻\n- Sink = `Stderr.writeLine (Json.encodeLogEvent logEvent)`\n\n`Logger` 構築自体は純粋。ID/時刻取得は `emit` 時に実行される。"},{"id":"testing","type":"text","x":280,"y":1600,"width":700,"height":330,"color":"5","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Testing`\n\n**テスト支援Facade**\n\n- 固定 EventId / ExecutionId / Timestamp\n- `newMemoryLogger`\n- `newFailureLogger`\n- `newCountingFailureLogger`\n- 固定 `LogEvent` / テストイベント\n\nproductionと同じRuntimeへ、テスト用依存を差し替える。"},{"id":"runtime","type":"text","x":1550,"y":-250,"width":750,"height":800,"color":"6","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Runtime`\n\n**Loggerの実行機構**\n\n`Logger` が保持:\n- `minimumLevel`\n- `component`\n- `context`\n- `EventIdSource :: IO EventId`\n- `Clock :: IO Timestamp`\n- `Sink :: LogEvent -> IO (Either LoggingFailure ())`\n\n`emit`:\n1. 閉じたイベント → `EventSpec`\n2. minimum levelでfilter\n3. 出力対象だけ EventId / Timestamp取得\n4. `SchemaV1` + component + context を足して `LogEvent` 完成\n5. 注入済みSinkを1回呼ぶ\n\n`LoggingFailure` は現在 `LoggingSinkFailure`。JSONやstderrの具体像は知らない。"},{"id":"core","type":"text","x":1550,"y":700,"width":750,"height":780,"color":"6","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Core`\n\n**Aeson・IO非依存の純粋なログモデル**\n\n主な型:\n- Envelope: `SchemaVersion`, `ExecutionId`, `EventId`, `Timestamp`\n- `Component`, `EventContext`\n- `LogLevel`, `OperationName`, `EventName`\n- `Payload`, nullを持たない `LogValue`\n- `LogError`\n- `EventSpec`\n- 完成形 `LogEvent`\n- `ToEventSpec`\n\n`failedEventSpec` が **event=`failed` / level=`error` / error必須** を同じ生成経路で保証する。\n\nしないこと: ID生成、現在時刻取得、level判定、JSON変換、出力IO。"},{"id":"sink-contract","type":"text","x":2650,"y":-50,"width":650,"height":400,"color":"6","text":"## Sink境界\n\n```haskell\ntype Sink =\n  LogEvent -> IO (Either LoggingFailure ())\n```\n\nRuntimeは **どのSinkかを選ばない**。SetupやTestingが構築時に注入する。\n\nこの境界が production stderr / memory / failure を同じ `Logger` 実行機構へ接続する。"},{"id":"json","type":"text","x":3450,"y":-250,"width":700,"height":720,"color":"6","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Backend.Json`\n\n**`LogEvent` → JSON の純粋な契約変換**\n\n`encodeLogEvent :: LogEvent -> ByteString`\n\n- `SchemaV1` → `1`\n- componentを `ragscope_app` / `ai_service` へ固定\n- error categoryを契約上の文字列へ固定\n- `EventContext` を `scope` / `execution_id` へ変換\n- `errorInfo` → `error`\n- `schemaVersion` / `eventId` → snake_case\n- `Nothing` のoptional keyを省略\n\nCoreをAeson非依存に保つため、ToJSON instanceはここへ集中。**回復可能なJSON変換失敗経路は持たない。**"},{"id":"stderr-backend","type":"text","x":4250,"y":650,"width":650,"height":470,"color":"6","text":"# `RAGScope.Logging.Backend.Stderr`\n\n**encoding済み1イベントの出力IOだけを担当**\n\n`writeLine`:\n- stderrへ1行出力\n- `hFlush stderr`\n- 書き込み/flushの `IOException` を `LoggingSinkFailure` へ変換\n\nJSON・Aeson・LogEventの構造を知らない。"},{"id":"schema","type":"text","x":5350,"y":-250,"width":650,"height":520,"color":"3","text":"# JSON Schema v1\n\n`contracts/logging/v1/log-event.schema.json`\n\n**外部JSON契約の機械可読な正本**\n\n`Backend.Json` の出力を型・変換テスト・Schema適合テストで拘束する。\n\nHaskellの内部constructor名やfield名を、そのまま外部契約へ漏らさない。"},{"id":"stderr","type":"text","x":5350,"y":650,"width":650,"height":260,"color":"3","text":"## stderr\n\n**構造化ログ専用**\n\nproductionでは1イベント = 1 JSON行。\n標準エラーへのIO失敗は `LoggingSinkFailure` として値で返す。"},{"id":"stdout","type":"text","x":5350,"y":1200,"width":650,"height":180,"color":"3","text":"## stdout\n\n**正常なCLI結果の出力先。Loggingの外側。**\n\n構造化ログと混在させない。"},{"id":"tests","type":"text","x":1250,"y":2500,"width":2700,"height":580,"color":"2","text":"# 現在の自動テスト境界\n\n- `Execution.ResultSpec`\n- `Execution.ObservationSpec`\n- `Logging.RuntimeSpec`\n- `Logging.Backend.JsonSpec`\n- `Logging.SchemaSpec`\n- `Logging.OutputBoundarySpec`\n\n検査する中心:\n- 4通りの機能結果 × ログ結果の解釈\n- 必須ログを1回試行\n- level filter / ID・時刻付加\n- JSON契約とSchema適合\n- stdout / stderr分離\n- Sink失敗時に再帰出力しない"}],"edges":[{"id":"e-feature-observe","fromNode":"feature","fromSide":"right","toNode":"observation","toSide":"left","label":"featureAction"},{"id":"e-error-featurelog","fromNode":"app-error","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"feature-log","toSide":"top","label":"安全な情報だけ投影"},{"id":"e-observe-featurelog","fromNode":"observation","fromSide":"right","toNode":"feature-log","toSide":"left","label":"feature result → recordResult"},{"id":"e-observe-result","fromNode":"observation","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"result","toSide":"top","label":"ExecutionOutcome"},{"id":"e-featurelog-logging","fromNode":"feature-log","fromSide":"right","toNode":"logging","toSide":"left","label":"閉じたイベントをemit"},{"id":"e-featurelog-eventspec","fromNode":"feature-log","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"eventspec","toSide":"left","label":"ToEventSpec / constructors"},{"id":"e-logging-runtime","fromNode":"logging","fromSide":"right","toNode":"runtime","toSide":"left","label":"emitを委譲"},{"id":"e-eventspec-core","fromNode":"eventspec","fromSide":"right","toNode":"core","toSide":"left","label":"低水準構築API"},{"id":"e-runtime-core","fromNode":"runtime","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"core","toSide":"top","label":"Core型でLogEvent完成"},{"id":"e-setup-runtime","fromNode":"setup","fromSide":"right","toNode":"runtime","toSide":"top","label":"mkLogger / production依存を注入"},{"id":"e-runtime-sink","fromNode":"runtime","fromSide":"right","toNode":"sink-contract","toSide":"left","label":"完成LogEventを渡す"},{"id":"e-sink-json","fromNode":"sink-contract","fromSide":"right","toNode":"json","toSide":"left","label":"production Sink: encode"},{"id":"e-json-schema","fromNode":"json","fromSide":"right","toNode":"schema","toSide":"left","label":"外部契約へ変換"},{"id":"e-json-stderr","fromNode":"json","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"stderr-backend","toSide":"top","label":"encoding済みデータ"},{"id":"e-stderr-output","fromNode":"stderr-backend","fromSide":"right","toNode":"stderr","toSide":"left","label":"1 JSON行"},{"id":"e-testing-tests","fromNode":"testing","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tests","toSide":"top","label":"固定値・test Logger"}]}